The place had been first discovered by Sophie and Cherit, when Dante sent them to look for a Foundation Library while he and Lok went to [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]]. As they entered they had been observed by [[Lane]] and [[Dellix]]. Inside they found the key to a Casterwill cypher. {{source|Memory Lane}}

Later the whole team returned there to look for information about Willblade. It was then when they first encountered [[Lucas Casterwill|Lucas]] and his teammates. The two teams fought before coming to an understanding. {{source|Chasing Void}}

Sophie, [[Lok]] and [[Cherit]] returned to the library to update Lucas and his team on the emergence of the [[Blood Spiral]] after their failed mission to recover [[Void]] from [[Klaus' bookshop]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}

Lucas, [[Lane]] and [[Dellix]] were residing here when [[Lok Lambert]] summoned [[Quetzalcoatl]], and activated the [[Blue Star]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

The library was also one of Sophie's recurring childhood memories. {{source|Memory Lane}} {{source|Chasing Void}} {{source|The Phoenix's Ashes}}

